SOAPBOX: 10m was best for my QRP, 15m good also.
SOAPBOX: Tnx to all for your patience and the QSOs,
SOAPBOX: and a chance to see if my mic still works.
SOAPBOX: GO ARIZONA OUTLAWS! -73- John N6HI
